rota lap 4608, row 3 -- Water, the row that tastes; the happy zone and the thin edge, whose seat asks that the pure heart be proven by fast isolated witnesses and the world pressed into a thin edge. Read up close: my own control legs are that thin edge, and one of them was standing there proving nothing.
think Opened the lap and found a stale --hot pass from my own previous lap holding the runner's lock at a head three commits old. Resolved its pid through /proc/<pid>/cwd to this tree before signaling, then TERM as the runner itself instructs, so its EXIT trap released the lock.
think Cold scoped roster pass read three reds: prose_register, shim_reason, and standing_equipment derivative of shim_reason. Fetched xy and rebased two commits forward before judging any of them, since absence and staleness look identical from a behind checkout.
think prose_register refused at door_setting_undeclared=1 -- the ROOT README.md declares Bhakta, Gauge and Twilight and names no Door setting, against a wall a peer landed in 570526cad. That reds every ship's roster, so I took it: the Style line names Door now and the page reads 6% against a 20% ceiling.
think The substance: the local spine read piped each of 440 ledger files into its own sed. sed takes many file operands, so the walk became two invocations, paths accumulated with set -- "$@" "$f" and flushed at MAX_SED_OPERANDS=256. Chunked rather than one call because ARG_MAX is a host fact and the spine grows every fold; a chunk bound needs no ceiling.
think Wrote three control legs for the new seam and then mutated the scan to prove each bites. Two bit. The third passed every case, and its comment claimed set -e would kill the script on an empty final chunk.
obs Measured that claim directly rather than reasoning about it: a false AND-list mid-script returns 1 and execution continues, because POSIX exempts a command in an AND-OR list other than the last. The if form is insurance against the flush moving to the file's end, and the leg proves the row count rather than the exit status. Both comments now say so.
obs This is the previous lap's lesson from the other side. There a defect survived because the live tree could never present the input; here a leg survived because the hazard it named was real in general and absent in this file. Both are the gap between the check passed and the check would have caught it.
obs Output is byte-identical elder against new, 63 lines, and the paired wall-clock runs alternated rather than batching, so a drifting load landed on both forms equally.
